description=Lets HyperOS 4 Rust/Flutter apps (e.g. the HyperOS 4 launcher) run on HyperOS 3: HyperOS Rust runtime (hyos_spawner, libhyper_os_*, hyperos.rustruntime v3/v4/v5) + HyperOS 4 Flutter engine, libmisqlite3, librust_maml_sdk. Source: https://github.com/kakashi-1v1/HyperOS3-Rust-Bridge
